title: The <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> joins the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>
subtitle: [? if gold_votes < 4 and gold_leader != "Glatzel": Struggling at the polls, the party tries to stay relevant by merging into a larger bloc?][? if gold_leader == "Glatzel": Glatzel's views align closely with the chancellor's?].
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and staal_time >= 11 and not lvp_formed and gold_exist and ((gold_votes < 4 and not bourgeois_list) or gold_leader == "Glatzel") and gnu_formed and next_election_time - time < 2 and gold_ideology != "Left" and not gold_r_alt
new-page: true
priority: 1
tags: event
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/portraits/schleicher.jpg

= <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> joins the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>

[? if gold_votes < 4 and gold_leader != "Glatzel": The electoral decline of the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> and the threat of being wiped out of parliament due to the Commonwealth's imperfect proportional system have forced the party to abandon its political independence and join Staal's <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>. This decision has faced significant internal objections, as many still hope for an understanding with the propertied and right-wing parties to secure a place on their electoral list. ?]
[? if gold_leader == "Glatzel": Frank Glatzel, leader of the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>, shares much ideological ground with Staal's new party—nationalism, corporatism, and the goal of a <i>national community</i>. A merger with the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span> has thus become inevitable. ?]

[? if gold_votes < 4 and gold_leader != "Glatzel": Nonetheless, the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> and its industrial backers will bolster the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> and legitimize it among the middle class, eliminating yet another option for non-<span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> propertied voters. ?]
[? if gold_leader == "Glatzel": Glatzel's vision of a "new nationalism" will carry a sizable following into his new political home, along with his affiliated white-collar union, the DHV, which he is bringing into the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> as well. ?]

- @schleicher_2: The <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span> welcomes its new member.

@schleicher_2
on-arrival: {!
Q.gold_gnu = 1

Q.pro_republic -= Q.gold_votes;

Q.gold_relation = (Q.gnu_relation - 20);

Q.gnu_r += Q.gold_r;
Q.gold_r = 0;
!}


Current composition of the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">Commonwealth National Unity Front</span>:

[? if gnu_formed: - <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> ?]

[? if dstp_gnu: - <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> ?]

[? if lvp_gnu: - <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> ?]

[? if unionist_gnu: - <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> ?]

[? if unionist_gnu: - <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> ?]

[? if gold_gnu: - <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> ?]

[? if other_gnu: - **Others** ?]

[? if kvp_gnu: - <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span> ?]

[? if traditionalist_gnu: - <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> ?]

[? if nvf_gnu: - <span style="color: #142e20;">**NVF**</span> ?]